# 默认按文本处理并统一为 LF，避免 Windows / Linux 之间产生无意义的整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换
*.zip   binary
*.ico   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary

# 版本记录与安装手册面向 Windows 记事本，保留 CRLF
更新记录.txt text eol=crlf

# 语言统计与 diff 提示
*.php   linguist-language=PHP
*.php   diff=php
